<div class="col-md-11 text-center">
<h3>Digital Tutorials</h3>
<p class="my-5">Our interactive tutorials will be accessible anytime, anywhere and allow you to work at your own pace without sacrificing on content or engagement.</p>
<h3>Coming Soon</h3>
